<title>SINGAPORE: IPCO managing director resigns.</title>
<headline>IPCO managing director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>IPCO International Ltd said  on Monday managing director Charles Stanley Hardeman had resigned with effect from May 9.</p>
<p>Hardeman would be replaced by Benety Chang, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>IPCO also said Lee Keat Hin would be chairman of the board, with effect from May 9, 1997.</p>
<p>It gave no reason for Hardeman's resignation.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
